Common implementations to remember

Interface	Implementation	Main characteristic
List	    ArrayList	    Fast indexed access
List	    LinkedList  	Linked-node structure
Set     	HashSet	        Unique elements; no guaranteed order
Set	        LinkedHashSet	Unique elements; insertion order
Set	        TreeSet     	Unique elements; sorted order
Queue	    PriorityQueue	Elements ordered by priority
Map	        HashMap	        Key-value storage; no guaranteed iteration order
Map	        TreeMap     	Keys sorted by natural order or comparator


















